+	function mergeFar(sel: (TileXYZ & { _d?: number })[], cam: CameraPose, minZoom: number, done: (s: TileXYZ[]) => boolean): (TileXYZ & { _d?: number })[] {
+		const c = cam.center, minZ = Math.max(0, minZoom);
+		const dist = (t: TileXYZ): number => { const [w, s, e, n] = tileBounds(t.x, t.y, t.z); return Math.hypot((w + e) / 2 - c[0], (s + n) / 2 - c[1]); };
+		for (let guard = 0; !done(sel) && guard < 32; guard++) {
